---
const steps = [
  {
    number: '1',
    title: '明确预期',
    detail: '写清必须能力、允许涌现的能力与不可接受结果。'
  },
  {
    number: '2',
    title: '定义空间',
    detail: '选择元素、关系、组合、不变性、变化规则与输出。'
  },
  {
    number: '3',
    title: '核算监督',
    detail: '检查局部目标、独立关系、分布覆盖、噪声与归因。'
  },
  {
    number: '4',
    title: '试探 Scaling',
    detail: '联合改变数据和模型规模，对照代理 loss 与真实效用。'
  }
]
---

<figure
  class='not-prose my-8 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card'
  aria-labelledby='practice-path-title practice-path-caption'
>
  <div class='p-3 sm:p-5'>
    <p id='practice-path-title' class='m-0 text-base font-semibold text-foreground'>
      从直觉到实践的四步路径
    </p>
    <p class='mb-0 mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground'>
      先决定学习方向，再决定数据和模型预算投向哪里。
    </p>
  </div>

  <ol class='m-0 grid list-none border-y border-border/60 p-0 md:grid-cols-4' role='list'>
    {
      steps.map((step, index) => (
        <li
          class:list={[
            'grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-3 gap-y-1 px-3 py-4 sm:px-5 md:block',
            index > 0 && 'border-t border-border/60 md:border-l md:border-t-0'
          ]}
        >
          <span class='row-span-2 flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded bg-primary/15 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground'>
            {step.number}
          </span>
          <span class='font-semibold text-foreground md:mt-2 md:block'>{step.title}</span>
          <span class='text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground md:mt-1 md:block'>
            {step.detail}
          </span>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>

  <figcaption
    id='practice-path-caption'
    class='px-3 py-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-5'
  >
    图 2：每轮真实效用评测都可能要求回到第一步，修正预期、空间或监督设计。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
